WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.437
This query consumes the employee performance interface.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:09.202
The total-sales threshold remains outside the view.

00:00:09.202 --> 00:00:14.587
That is useful because different reports may choose different thresholds.

00:00:14.587 --> 00:00:22.557
The stable performance definition stays shared, while temporary business rules remain report-specific.

00:00:22.557 --> 00:00:28.837
A standard view stores a query definition, not a separate copy of the rows.

00:00:28.837 --> 00:00:36.012
Treat the selected columns, names, types, and grain as a contract with downstream users.

00:00:36.012 --> 00:00:43.422
Changing that contract can break dashboards or applications even if the underlying query still runs.
